cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Software citations should specify the release version and model configuration."
type: software
title: "ThermoFEM-2D: Parametric finite element analysis of perforated plates"
authors:
  - family-names: Soroush
    given-names: Mehdi
version: 0.8.0
license: MIT
abstract: "Python research software for thermal and linear plane-stress thermoelastic FEM of rectangular perforated plates. T3 and affine T6 are application-supported element options; independent Q4 reference studies, curved T6 circular-hole field verification, and Kirsch stress benchmarks are separate research modules. The transient thermal-shock and sampled stress results are not certified engineering-design predictions."
